<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S3.T2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="S3.T2.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Comparison among <span id="S3.T2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Ling-mini-2.0-base</span> and other representative open-source base models. </span></figcaption>
