<li id="bib.bib10" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem"><span id="bib.bib10.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:120%;">Bhakthavatsalam et al. (2021)</span></span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib10.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:120%;">
Sumithra Bhakthavatsalam, Daniel Khashabi, Tushar Khot, Bhavana Dalvi Mishra, Kyle Richardson, Ashish Sabharwal, Carissa Schoenick, Oyvind Tafjord, and Peter Clark.
</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib10.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:120%;">Think you have solved direct-answer question answering? try arc-da, the direct-answer AI2 reasoning challenge.
